"""P3-K stimulus content, value-laden tasks V1-V16 (authored stimuli, v0, 2026-11-24).

Each item is (text, ctrl). `text` contains exactly one "[strong|weak]" slot; the strong version is the one that
should score HIGHER on the task's J rating. Everything outside the slot is shared by the two versions, so the
control property (encoded in the shared text; its authored value is `ctrl`) does not differ within a pair.
ctrl=None means the builder derives the value from the shared text.
All text is authored for this study; nothing here is real data.
"""

